   "en": "\"Living apart from your only family, your sister?\" NO!\n\"Can I dress up as a man?\" YES!\n\nThe work is extremely white, with live-in pay.\nThere's no way I'm going to do such a part-time job.\nYuzu Asahina, for various reasons, is quitting JK and entering the boys' dormitory from today!\nOf course, I'm going to dress up as a man and go to\n\nThe only people who know I'm a woman are the other students in the dorm.\nAll of them have strong habits, but Fujiwara Ryukan is a little different.\n\nI gave up on youth and started living in a dormitory, but both youth and love came along with it!"
